      "model_name": "openrouter/anthropic/claude-opus-4-6",
      "message": "Now I have all the data I need. Let me extract the Judicial Branch outlay values for FY 2007-2013:\n\nFrom the 2010 bulletin:\n- FY 2007: 6,008\n- FY 2008: 6,345\n- FY 2009: 6,643\n\nFrom the 2014 bulletin:\n- FY 2009: 6,643 (matches!)\n- FY 2010: 7,185\n- FY 2011: 7,295\n- FY 2012: 7,228\n- FY 2013: 7,066\n\nNow let me compute everything in Python:",
      "tool_calls": [
